Changes: transaction lines aggregated by invoice date; nonpositive prices and
zero quantities excluded; cancellation classification based on invoice prefix
or negative quantity; extended line amounts rounded half-up to GBP pence;
customer identifiers and descriptions omitted. Source hashes and full
transformation notes are included in the derived dataset and data/README.md.
The dashboard's fixed USD/GBP replay rate is illustrative, not historical FX.

